<title>USA: Cooperative Computing extends Triad tender.</title>
<headline>Cooperative Computing extends Triad tender.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooperative Computing Inc said Thursday the tender offer for Triad Systems Corp shares has been extended until January 3.</p>
<p>Cooperative Computing said 11.9 million shares representing 67.1 percent of Triad's outstanding shares had been tendered as of December 11.</p>
<p>The $9.25 cash per share offer for Triad shares was originally to expire December 13, tne company said.</p>
<p>Triad shares were up 1/8 Thursday at 8-1/2.</p>
